patient enough could make himself a precise table of item weights
using gold and rocks as tools. You just load yourself with aforementioned
items until you are burdened, drop as much gold as to become unburdened,
pick the item in question and drop rocks/gold until you are unburdened
again. Easy? As first you have of course to find the weight of a gold coin
(exercise for the reader: n gold coins make one 'nethack weight unit' - find
what n is. Second exercise for the reader: use the above method to find the
weight of one rock). Easy? No. Possible? Yes. Then don't overload the game
